Skills: Platforms

Purpose:
  Infrastructure and platform skills organized by technology and competency layers.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1  @INDEX.sdd
   2  @docker/
   3  @kubernetes/
   4  @aws/
   5  @terraform/

Modes:
  LEARN    — learn platform fundamentals
  APPLY    — apply platform skills to infrastructure
  REVIEW   — review platform skills
  UPGRADE  — propose platform skill upgrade

Rules:
  [P1]  Skills MUST be organized by platform technology.
  [P2]  Each platform MUST have L1-L4 layers.
  [P3]  Skills MUST cover deployment and operations.
  [P4]  Skills MUST be loaded on demand.
  [P5]  Platform skills MUST NOT contain project-specific content.

Entry:
  Read:
    INDEX.sdd

  Resolve:
    docker
    kubernetes
    aws
    terraform

Navigation:
  Platforms: @platforms/INDEX.sdd
  Docker: @platforms/docker/INDEX.sdd
  Kubernetes: @platforms/kubernetes/INDEX.sdd
  AWS: @platforms/aws/INDEX.sdd
  Terraform: @platforms/terraform/INDEX.sdd

State: +
